>>>
<<<
ANCHOR
===
This instrument therefore furnishes 15 major chords and as many minor chords, with perfectly pure Thirds, but with Fifths too flat by 1/8 of the interval by which an equally tempered Fifth is too flat.§ On the Lower Manual we have the

