Footnote: ⁎ [On account of the approximate character of the calculation, the extreme closeness of result is not well shewn. Taking the accurate ¶ numbers, the ratio \(b_1 \div c\flat = \frac{32805}{32768}\), giving cents 1·953721. ANCHOR
